 Desmotheca {{small|Lindb.}}
 Florschuetziella {{small|Vitt}}
 Groutiella {{small|Steere}}
 Leiomitrium {{small|Mitt.}}
 Leratia {{small|Broth. & Paris}}
 Lewinskya {{small|F.Lara, Garilleti & Goffinet}}
 Macrocoma {{small|(Hornsch. ex Müll.Hal.) Grout}}
 Macromitrium {{small|Brid.}}
 Matteria {{small|Goffinet}}
 Nyholmiella {{small|Holmen & E.Warncke}}
 Orthotrichum {{small|Hedw.}}
 Pentastichella {{small|Müll.Hal.}}
 Plenogemma {{small|Plášek, Sawicki & Ochyra}}
 Pulvigera {{small|Plášek, Sawicki & Ochyra}}
 Rehubryum {{small|F.Lara, Garilleti & Draper}}
